      "body": "Lumax Industries Limited at the AGM to be held on August 24, 2026 recommended Final Dividend of INR 55/- per Equity Share (550%) of the Face Value of INR 10/-for the Financial Year 2025-26 subject to the approval of Shareholders in the ensuing Annual General Meeting of the Company; The dividend, if approved by the Shareholders, will be paid within 30 days of approval/declaration. The company also proposed to fix August 06, 2026 as the \"Record Date\", pursuant to the provisions of Regulation 42 of the Listing Regulations, 2015, for purpose of determining the shareholders eligible to receive Dividend on the equity shares for the Financial Year 2025-26.",
